				<u>Hisp.</u>
				35
			</span></i> ; <i>restrain</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Epict.</u>
				3.7.28
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρίχας ῥεούσας π</span>.
